  "notes": "A designer–client review tool for chart graphics. Distinctive: the right 'Reconcile before you reply' panel turns three parallel audience-scoped conversations (Client review, Data & methodology, Studio only with lock) into decisions — status chips per conversation ('Needs your position on the axis'), radio option cards with Recommended/Not recommended badges and explicit trade-offs that live-preview the chart ('Preview only. Nothing here changes v3 as sent.'), suggested date chips, a disabled 'Draft client reply from these decisions' button, and a v4 change checklist. Chart points are clickable to pin into the next message; numbered pins on the chart link to message chips. Messages carry colored role tags (STUDIO purple, CLIENT blue) and version tags (v1/v2/v3). Warm off-white paper background with deep teal primary; status text uses green/amber/red. Toast and tooltip observed only on the live page."
}
